@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Notification Methods retrieval collaboration boundary
component "Test inputs\nand assertions" as Test
rectangle "Declared real collaboration SUT" {
 component Controller
component "Notification Service" as Service
component "Sending Notification" as Mechanism
 Controller --> Service
 Service --> Mechanism
}
Test --> Controller


note bottom of Service
  "Notification Service" in this graph is a stand-in
  for the different implementations of
  INotificationService that will need their
  specific behaviour tested.
end note

note bottom of Mechanism
  "Sending Notification" is a stand-in for what would be the specific notification channel protocol (SMS, e-mail, webhook (https))
end note
@enduml
